# Anything listed here is excluded from the deployment uploaded to Vercel.
# It stays in the repo — it just stops being shipped and stored per deployment.

# Full-resolution photo originals (~1.1 GB). The site only ever serves the
# downsized exports in assets/img/{coaches,events,classes,camps,partners,brand},
# which the tools/build-*-photos.sh scripts generate from these.
assets/img/Photos/

# Build-time tooling and tests — never requested by a browser.
tools/
tests/

# Source data for the generators, not served.
news.txt

# Apps Script source for the Sheets backup; deployed to Google, not Vercel.
integrations/

# Internal working notes.
CHECKLIST.md
CLIENT_CHANGES_2026-09.md
README.md

# OS cruft.
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
